"00:54.102">I'm</span> <span begin="00:54.102" end="00:55.427">not</span> <span begin="00:55.427" end="00:55.850">the</span> <span begin="00:55.850" end="00:56.936">same</span> <span begin="00:56.936" end="00:57.250">as</span> <span begin="00:57.250" end="00:57.810">I</span> <span begin="00:57.810" end="00:58.991">was</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我已然不是昨日的自己</span></p><p begin="01:00.510" end="01:05.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="01:00.510" end="01:00.944">As</span> <span begin="01:00.944" end="01:01.413">I</span> <span begin="01:01.413" end="01:02.374">shoul</span><span begin="01:02.374" end="01:02.798">der</span> <span begin="01:02.798" end="01:03.322">the</span> <span begin="01:03.322" end="01:04.245">weight</span> <span begin="01:04.245" end="01:04.686">of</span> <span begin="01:04.686" end="01:05.051">the</span> <span begin="01:05.051" end="01:05.707">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我肩负起 一个世界的重任</span></p><p begin="01:06.690" end="01:13.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:06.690" end="01:06.905">I</span> <span begin="01:06.905" end="01:07.312">was</span> <span begin="01:07.312" end="01:07.837">set</span><span begin="01:07.837" end="01:08.100">ting</span> <span begin="01:08.100" end="01:08.765">in</span> <span begin="01:08.765" end="01:09.637">stone</span> <span begin="01:10.332" end="01:10.491">un</span><span begin="01:10.491" end="01:10.787">til</span> <span begin="01:10.787" end="01:10.948">I</span> <span begin="01:10.948" end="01:11.473">no</span><span begin="01:11.473" end="01:11.892">ticed</span> <span begin="01:11.892" end="01:12.209">it</span> <span begin="01:12.209" end="01:13.123">right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我本一成不变 直至我察觉对错</span></p><p begin="01:13.934" end="01:16.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:13.934" end="01:14.101">Do</span> <span begin="01:14.101" end="01:14.504">you</span> <span begin="01:14.504" end="01:15.021">see</span> <span begin="01:15.021" end="01:15.443">how</span> <span begin="01:15.443" end="01:15.898">you've</span> <span begin="01:15.898" end="01:16.801">grown?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你可见证了 我的成长历程</span></p><p begin="01:17.558" end="01:19.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:17.558" end="01:17.823">Don't</span> <span begin="01:17.823" end="01:18.343">be</span> <span begin="01:18.343" end="01:19.058">sor</span><span begin="01:19.058" end="01:19.273">ry,</span> <span begin="01:19.273" end="01:19.878">then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不必心怀歉意</span></p><p begin="01:21.272" end="01:24.982" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:21.272" end="01:21.406">And</span> <span begin="01:21.406" end="01:21.800">I</span> <span begin="01:21.800" end="01:22.349">fall</span> <span begin="01:22.349" end="01:22.778">from</span> <span begin="01:22.778" end="01:23.234">my</span> <span begin="01:23.234" end="01:24.982">bones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在脱胎换骨之后</span></p><p begin="01:24.982" end="01:28.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:24.982" end="01:25.172">And</span> <span begin="01:25.172" end="01:25.366">now</span> <span begin="01:25.366" end="01:25.614">I</span> <span begin="01:25.614" end="01:26.072">know</span> <span begin="01:26.072" end="01:26.447">I'm</span> <span begin="01:26.447" end="01:26.919">a</span><span begin="01:26.919" end="01:28.022">live</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">终于明白 我已重获新生</span></p><p begin="01:28.977" end="01:33.455" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:28.977" end="01:29.241">I</span> <span begin="01:29.241" end="01:29.634">want</span> <span begin="01:29.634" end="01:30.017">you</span> <span begin="01:30.017" end="01:30.433">to</span> <span begin="01:30.433" end="01:32.339">find</span> <span begin="01:32.339" end="01:33.455">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望你 也会发现</span><