</span><span begin="02:17.349" end="02:18.041">gic</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你总是那么怀旧</span></p><p begin="02:18.655" end="02:25.959" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:18.655" end="02:19.082">What</span> <span begin="02:19.082" end="02:19.539">do</span> <span begin="02:19.539" end="02:19.932">we</span> <span begin="02:19.932" end="02:20.661">wan</span><span begin="02:20.661" end="02:21.321">der</span> <span begin="02:21.321" end="02:22.646">from</span> <span begin="02:23.084" end="02:23.254">and</span> <span begin="02:23.254" end="02:23.431">on</span><span begin="02:23.431" end="02:23.711">ly</span> <span begin="02:23.711" end="02:24.141">no</span><span begin="02:24.141" end="02:24.576">tice</span> <span begin="02:24.576" end="02:24.955">it</span> <span begin="02:24.955" end="02:25.959">now?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一路而来的起点 怎么现在才意识到</span></p><p begin="02:27.131" end="02:29.670" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:27.131" end="02:27.398">So</span> <span begin="02:27.398" end="02:27.828">be</span> <span begin="02:27.828" end="02:28.216">here</span> <span begin="02:28.216" end="02:28.745">with</span> <span begin="02:28.745" end="02:29.670">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">请你与我一起</span></p><p begin="02:35.041" end="02:41.076" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:35.041" end="02:35.510">And</span> <span begin="02:35.510" end="02:35.942">I</span> <span begin="02:35.942" end="02:37.466">watched</span> <span begin="02:37.466" end="02:37.685">the</span> <span begin="02:37.685" end="02:38.451">wa</span><span begin="02:38.451" end="02:39.153">ter</span> <span begin="02:39.153" end="02:39.653">un</span><span begin="02:39.653" end="02:41.076">fold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">冻结的水域 在我眼前渐渐消融</span></p><p begin="02:42.219" end="02:47.416" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:42.219" end="02:42.689">It's</span> <span begin="02:42.6